# Product-Docs Workflow Bootstrap

When a user introduces a **new idea**, read [`product-docs/methodology/README.md`](../../product-docs/methodology/README.md) — the whole method now fits in that one document (documentary levels, discoverability, values compass, and the three rules worth keeping).

Quick orientation only:

- Prefer **Plan mode** for research, challenge, and comparing alternatives; the methodology is support, not a competing workflow.
- Closeout: classify **hygiene vs program** before inventing `I-*` / `TB-*` — see the methodology README § *Three rules worth keeping*.
- GitHub issues: [`.cursor/rules/github-issue-labels.mdc`](github-issue-labels.mdc) — labels at create time.
